& [CanonicalRecord: PostIR7ImplementationReadiness] is the processed planning authority for the post-IR7 implementation readiness surface
  + [canonical_uuid] is d039f1ef-29e2-43ba-8428-ad849ad46896
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is a424ea99-9cf3-4c9d-9e58-0a45a76fc56a
  + [surface_uuid] is ad334cd6-cf98-41dc-a3e0-f2c67c6ec8d9
  + [authority_scope] is post-IR7 IR8 readiness, final-slice minting authority, integrated manager orchestration planning, gating rules, model routing, forbidden scope, expected outputs, and verification obligations
  + [implementation_scope] is IR8 planning readiness authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR2_Parser_Projection_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR3_Operator_Harness_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR4_LangGraph_Proof_Runtime_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR5_Surface_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Projection_Prototype_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR7_Operations_Dry_Run_Simulator_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/IR7_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC5_Operations_Safety_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Post_IR6_Implementation_Readiness.canonical.sop

  = must: use docs/planning/Post_IR7_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop as the current post-IR7 readiness surface
  = must: mint IR8 final slices before writing integrated manager orchestration code, fixture files, expected ledgers, generated outputs, dependencies, adapters, transports, UI, or package metadata
  = must: preserve accepted IR2 through IR7 proof packs and FSC5 operations safety as boundary inputs
  = must: preserve that post-IR7 readiness does not authorize integrated manager implementation, agent dispatch, adapter implementation, operations control, or live machine control
  - never: treat post-IR7 readiness records as command, process, GPU, model runtime, job dispatch, credential, network, destructive filesystem, automation, operations-control, or live machine-control permission

& [CanonicalIR8ReadinessChunk] is the post-IR7 implementation chunk record
  + [chunk] is IR8 integrated manager orchestration planning
  + [chunk_state] is ready_for_final_slice_minting
  + [activation_gate] is IR7 implementation proof accepted
  + [activation_gate] is FSC5 operations safety remains accepted
  + [downstream_implementation_activation_state] is gated_until_IR8_final_planning_acceptance
  + [adapter_transport_UI_dependency_state] is gated_until_explicit_bounded_non_live_authority
  + [live_control_authority_state] is blocked_until_separate_source_preserved_SJS_authority

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes the implementation surface
  = must: mark downstream implementation stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalIR8ReadinessModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [IR8_readiness] is requires deeper reasoning for manager orchestration, authority merging, readiness recomputation, work packet integration, graph execution handoff, coordination handoff, surface projection handoff, operation dry-run handoff, and future dispatch boundaries
  + [IR8_final_slice_minting] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR8_boundary_import] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR8_manager_loop_contract_design] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR8_coordination_surface_operations_handoff_contract] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR8_fixture_drafting] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after IR8 boundary, manager loop, and handoff contracts are accepted
  + [IR8_future_inert_implementation] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after IR8 implementation activation slices are accepted and implementation tasks are bounded
  + [IR8_live_control_reconsideration] is requires deeper reasoning and separate SJS safety authority

  = must: state Spark suitability or deeper-reasoning requirement in every future work packet

& [CanonicalIR8SafetyLimit] is the inherited safety limit for IR8 readiness
  + [manager_loop_record_status] is planning_record_only
  + [readiness_projection_record_status] is planning_record_only
  + [work_packet_record_status] is planning_record_only
  + [coordination_handoff_record_status] is planning_record_only
  + [operations_dry_run_handoff_record_status] is planning_record_only
  + [integrated_manager_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: block command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential access or mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent operations automation, operations control, and live machine control
  = must: prevent dry-run success, fixture success, broad approval, projected intent, mailbox carrier state, coordination claim state, surface projection state, or graph checkpoint state from becoming dispatch or live-control authority

